# "From anywhere" includes a library: Bot1's Thought Scour makes Bot2 mill two cards (CR 701.17a), which would be put into its graveyard
# and are exiled instead (CR 614.1a). Bot2's graveyard stays empty and its two top cards, the Lightning Bolt and Mox Ruby, are in exile; Thought
# Scour itself goes to Bot1's own graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of the Void
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Mox Ruby
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour
